WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:06.790
It appeared as though humanity 
would be destroyed by the demons.

2
00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:15.310
But a single mage saved them all.

3
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:27.600
He was called the Wizard King.
and he became a legend.

4
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:32.440
This is the Black Market.

5
00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:38.450
It's a bit dangerous. but they have 
some very effective magical items.

6
00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:41.450
Damn it. I lost again! Bah-ha...

7
00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:46.460
I can see the future.

8
00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:48.960
That old lady's good.

9
00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.550
I really shouldn't be 
wasting time here. anyway.

10
00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:55.670
Hey. she's cute!

11
00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:56.840
Bah-ha!

12
00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:01.890
The Black Market is no place 
for you lovely ladies. Bah-ha!

13
00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:03.680
Get lost. you insect.

14
00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:04.850
Bah-ha...

15
00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:08.730
Hey! I found something really cool!

16
00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:10.530
Bah-ha!

17
00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:12.360
Th-That's...

18
00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:15.350
Huh? Hey. you're Bah-ha!

19
00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:16.780
It's Sekke! Bah-ha!

20
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:18.920
How've you been. Bah-ha?

21
00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:22.280
The name's Bah-ha! No. wait. Sekke!

22
00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:23.490
Who's that?

23
00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:26.230
I took the Entrance Exam with him.

24
00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:29.000
Ah. you're a member of the 
Green Praying Mantises.

25
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:34.020
He's with two beautiful girls?! Wait. no...

26
00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:37.010
They're both members of 
the Black Bulls. too.

27
00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:41.360
Asta. you bastard! 
You're making me jealous.

28
00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:48.230
Besides. it's all your fault that 
I ended up in the Green Praying Mantises.

29
00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:52.060
Bah-ha! You infuriating bah-hastard!

30
00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:00.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

31
00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:17.550
The Wizard King Saw

32
00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:21.880
Grey words can't make anything happen

33
00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:24.550
I know. yeah I know

34
00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:29.800
Wishing to fly freely across the sky

35
00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:32.140
I dreamed it all my life

36
00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:35.690
Step by step I go. though 
it's a doubtful world 

37
00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:37.690
Don't care how much I fall

38
00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:41.160
Instinct is my guide. I never give up

39
00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:47.450
To faraway future. I burst out running

40
00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:52.920
Go beyond even the unseen fears

41
00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:58.000
The vision I had. so I can be myself

42
00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:03.260
Someday I will write the next page

43
00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:06.760
You are my hope

44
00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:09.520
Like that page from someday

45
00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:11.850
I was able to meet you

46
00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:14.810
I call this a miracle

47
00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.910
Are you out shopping with these girls?

48
00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:26.670
Well. today's our day off.

49
00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:28.700
Bah-ha! Must be nice.

50
00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:32.790
Even if it's your day off. shouldn't 
you be finding some basic tasks

51
00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:35.350
to do for points.
instead of messing around?

52
00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:38.090
I heard the Black Bulls 
have negative stars—

53
00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:40.650
Stars! Oh. yeah! Listen to this!

54
00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:44.220
We got a star from the
 Wizard King on our first mission!

55
00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:47.760
What?! You can't be serious!

56
00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:51.280
Well done. you two.

57
00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:54.400
They're serious?!

58
00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:56.900
Calm down. me.

59
00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:59.920
Bah-ha. bah-ha...

60
00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:03.150
I-I see! Seems like you're working hard.

61
00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:04.360
What about you. Bah-ha?

62
00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.770
It's Sekke!

63
00:04:05.770 --> 00:04:07.550
W-Well. I... The other day...

64
00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:10.230
I-I got my second star...

65
00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:21.130
Th-Thief!

66
00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:25.880
My winnings! Stop!

67
00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:32.220
That old lady...

68
00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:41.720
He's got some nerve.
 stealing in front of Magic Knights.

69
00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:45.570
No kidding. But everything will be 
fine if we leave it to the little boy.

70
00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:47.380
I'm counting on you.

71
00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:48.360
Bah-ha!

72
00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:51.810
I'm not going to let you 
steal all the glory. Asta!

73
00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:56.310
Bronze Creation Magic: Sekke Shooting Star!

74
00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:58.030
Lame!

75
00:04:58.030 --> 00:04:59.160
Gross!

76
00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:05.010
Leave this to me. You lovely ladies 
can go relax with that old lady.

77
00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:07.200
Ew!

78
00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.160
No!

79
00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.680
Bah-ha!

80
00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:13.670
Hold it!

81
00:05:16.070 --> 00:05:18.200
Just try and catch me.

82
00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:20.230
Stop. dang it!

83
00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.230
What the...

84
00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:36.830
Sorry!

85
00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:40.270
I finally lost him.

86
00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.630
Not yet!

87
00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:43.950
He's so damn persistent!

88
00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:50.050
I-I can't see!

89
00:05:57.110 --> 00:05:58.850
I'm not letting you get away!

90
00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:02.440
How is he catching up to me 
when he's only running?

91
00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:06.110
I have to do something about that cloud.
or I'll never catch up.

92
00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:08.490
If it's a cloud created by magic...

93
00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:09.200
Right!

94
00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:16.840
Do you actually think you can cut 
through my Bandit's Cloud Wind—

95
00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.080
What?!

96
00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:24.960
You're not getting away!

97
00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:31.130
Bah-ha!

98
00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:32.390
Bah-ha!

99
00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.930
I'm going to take the glory on this one!

100
00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:37.660
That's awesome!

101
00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.230
Bah-ha!

102
00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:45.240
Bah-ha! You're under arrest!

103
00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:48.730
He's my prey! Bah-hahaha!

104
00:06:48.730 --> 00:06:52.110
Bah-hahaha... huh?

105
00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:54.120
Bah-ha?

106
00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:57.390
That's...

107
00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.540
Knock off that stupid laugh of yours!

108
00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:02.960
I'm taking you down with me...

109
00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:10.630
What's wrong. Bah-ha?

110
00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:19.180
Poison... Poison's coursing through me.

111
00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:22.110
Hang in there. Bah-ha!

112
00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:23.890
Bah... ha...

113
00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:27.900
Am I going to die?

114
00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:33.150
Now that I think about it. I was 
once trying to get to the top. too...

115
00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:34.910
Bah-ha!

116
00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:39.580
I hate that I have to leave 
everything to him. but...

117
00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:44.080
You're the man who defeated me.

118
00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:47.840
Make it all the way to the 
top for my sake. too.

119
00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:51.750
I'm leaving my dream to you!

120
00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:52.840
Bah-ha...

121
00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:55.180
Bah-haha...

122
00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:02.250
I guess going out like this isn't so bad.

123
00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:04.690
Bah... ha...

124
00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:10.360
Bah-ha! Bah-ha!

125
00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:16.080
Huh? I'm not dying?

126
00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:18.800
Bah-ha?!

127
00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:22.240
Wh-What are you—

128
00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:25.870
Don't leave something so important with me!

129
00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:29.630
Survive and make your own dream come true!

130
00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:32.250
Don't give up. you idiot!

131
00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:37.300
Come on. There's no way this would kill you.

132
00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:38.850
Bah-ha?

133
00:08:38.850 --> 00:08:41.430
It's just a momentary numbing poison.

134
00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:44.880
Put this Shique ointment on it.
and you'll be better in no time.

135
00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:55.970
Bah-ha! Make sure you stay diligent 
until the next time I see you. Asta!

136
00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.410
See ya. bah-ha!

137
00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:00.410
See ya. Bah-ha!

138
00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:04.830
On the outside. our little boy 
definitely looks younger than him.

139
00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:07.930
but it seems our little boy is 
much stronger on the inside.

140
00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:12.810
Don't let it get taken again. ma'am.

141
00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:17.930
Thank you. Magic Knights.

142
00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:20.220
See ya. ma'am.

143
00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:21.710
Be careful.

144
00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:23.200
Live a long. happy life.

145
00:09:28.190 --> 00:09:30.690
Magic negation. eh?

146
00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:34.530
That's a type of magic 
I've never seen before.

147
00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:40.950
Actually... is that even magic?

148
00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:45.950
Yami sure took in an interesting kid.

149
00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:50.040
This is why I can't stop 
wandering around in disguise.

150
00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:53.030
I finally found you!

151
00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.260
Uh-oh...

152
00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:56.710
What in the world are you doing. Wizard King?

153
00:09:56.710 --> 00:10:02.740
28th Wizard King
Julius Novachrono

154
00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:04.010
What am I doing? I'm strolling through 
the castle town looking for new magic.

155
00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:07.810
What?! Have you any 
awareness of your position?!

156
00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:11.230
Encounters with magic are once in a lifetime.

157
00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:12.470
That doesn't—

158
00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:15.750
You never know what kind of magic 
you're going to encounter and where.

159
00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:18.530
Listen to me. you magic nerd!

160
00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:21.910
Now. now. calm down. Marx.

161
00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:27.410
Isn't that the new kid from William's squad?

162
00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:36.240
Well. I'm off to encounter even 
more new magic. I'll be back later.

163
00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:39.630
Wait. damn it!

164
00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:55.650
Member of the Golden Dawn
Klaus Lunettes

165
00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:56.530
The Golden Dawn's new recruit. Yuno...

166
00:10:55.650 --> 00:11:00.690
Member of the Golden Dawn
Yuno

167
00:10:57.200 --> 00:11:01.990
The candidate that every Magic Knight 
Captain wanted at the Entrance Exam.

168
00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:07.830
Member of the Golden Dawn
Mimosa Vermillion

169
00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:07.120
And then we have the other new recruit.
 Mimosa Vermillion. from the royal family.

170
00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:09.990
Their first mission is...

171
00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:14.570
to act as bodyguards 
for Salim de Hapshass.

172
00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:20.260
We are to escort the son of Hapshass.
who serves in the House of Lords.

173
00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:22.790
to our ally. the Heart Kingdom?

174
00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:26.180
You know who Lord Hapshass is. don't you?

175
00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:27.720
I know his name.

176
00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:33.690
I've only heard negative things about him.
such as that he's new money.

177
00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:39.140
I'm sure that's why he's worried that his son. 
who is going to study in the Heart Kingdom.

178
00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:42.200
might be attacked by bandits on the way.

179
00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:47.870
But there are many powerful mages 
among the lord's family...

180
00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:54.360
Apparently. he feels having Magic Knights
act as his bodyguards will be safer.

181
00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:59.970
Lord Hapshass makes very generous 
donations to the Magic Knights every year.

182
00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:03.020
so it's rather hard to decline.

183
00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:04.230
Do you object?

184
00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:05.550
N-No!

185
00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:11.770
We need to accept every kind of mission. 
That will also benefit the Clover Kingdom.

186
00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:14.090
Yes. sir. I am aware of that.

187
00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:16.520
Take Mimosa with you. too.

188
00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:20.190
I'm sure with you along as their mentor.
 they'll be more than enough.

189
00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:24.400
I'm counting on you to 
look after the new recruits.

190
00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:31.870
Salim de Hapshass lost to Yuno in the final 
part of the Magic Knights Entrance Exam.

191
00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:35.750
He ended up being unable 
to join the Magic Knights.

192
00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:40.090
So why was Yuno appointed 
as one of his bodyguards?

193
00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:43.090
My first mission... I'm so nervous.

194
00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:47.300
Klaus. Yuno. it's a 
pleasure to work with you.

195
00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.140
Yeah.

196
00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:51.270
Don't let your guard down. Mimosa.

197
00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:52.790
Y-Yes. sir.

198
00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:53.770
That goes for you. too.

199
00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:55.600
I know.

200
00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:57.670
You insolent newbie.

201
00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:05.610
How have you been. Yuno?

202
00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:10.190
Don't look so scary.

203
00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:15.120
I requested you as my bodyguard 
because I want to apologize.

204
00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:18.000
I hear that you intend to 
become the Wizard King.

205
00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:21.000
How did you know?

206
00:13:21.310 --> 00:13:25.530
You were chosen by all of the captains. 
You could've joined any squad.

207
00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:30.510
and you ended up choosing the 
Golden Dawn. so I had a feeling.

208
00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:33.270
The more you achieve from now on.

209
00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:37.360
the more your name will spread 
throughout the kingdom...

210
00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:41.290
Yuno. the one who bears the 
four-leaf clover grimoire.

211
00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:46.450
Make sure your dream of becoming 
the Wizard King comes true.

212
00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:51.050
And then I'll be able to 
brag to my future children

213
00:13:51.050 --> 00:13:54.280
that I once fought the Wizard King.

214
00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:58.540
And then they'll say. "Daddy. you're so cool!"

215
00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:02.200
We have some time before we 
get to the Heart Kingdom.

216
00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:05.030
Could you tell me a little 
more about yourself?

217
00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:07.550
I won't pester you if you're not up for it.

218
00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:10.220
I'm from Hage Village.

219
00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:17.890
I've heard of it. It's a village 
in the Forsaken Realm. isn't it?

220
00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:21.950
I think that's where the legend 
of the first Wizard King

221
00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:24.240
who defeated the demons comes from.

222
00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:29.250
It's not just a legend. A giant 
demon skull is actually still there.

223
00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:30.150
Oh?

224
00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:35.580
Apparently. I was found abandoned in 
front of a church when I was a baby.

225
00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:40.580
I've never seen my parents.
and I have no idea who they are.

226
00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:46.840
The church was very poor. but the father 
and sister there took very good care of me.

227
00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:48.430
I'm very grateful to them.

228
00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:48.910
No problems so far.

229
00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:51.560
but there must be someone 
in the Hapshass family

230
00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:53.250
who can use transportation magic.

231
00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:54.850
How did we get stuck with this?

232
00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:57.850
Not to mention. we're the only bodyguards.

233
00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:03.560
If there was a real threat of an attack. 
wouldn't they have more bodyguards?

234
00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:06.960
There are too many unknowns on this mission.

235
00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:08.960
Oh?

236
00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:11.030
What's that?

237
00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:17.530
Those clouds...

238
00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:19.870
They're a little creepy.

239
00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:22.660
I'll go check them out.

240
00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.320
Hey! No one said you could—

241
00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:28.880
Be on your guard. Mimosa.

242
00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:30.370
Y-Yes. sir.

243
00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:47.900
Yuno. protect the ship!

244
00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:50.150
I intend to.

245
00:15:57.230 --> 00:15:58.910
Go!

246
00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:44.660
That was magnificent!

247
00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:49.670
Were those men not after Salim?

248
00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:59.930
You saved me back there. Well done. Yuno.

249
00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:03.640
I didn't even have the opportunity 
to use my Lightning God Rising Salim.

250
00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.570
I'm even more interested in you now.

251
00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:11.640
I know. Why don't you take me to your town?

252
00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:15.270
I want to see the place where you were born.

253
00:17:15.270 --> 00:17:20.000
I want to know where you had 
to live to grow up so strong.

254
00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.870
Lord Salim. that's rather out of the way.

255
00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:25.470
Besides. given what just happened.

256
00:17:25.470 --> 00:17:27.750
we don't know what else 
might happen along the way.

257
00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:30.100
so we should head straight 
for the Heart Kingdom—

258
00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:35.150
No matter who may come after me.
 you three will protect me. won't you?

259
00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.270
Well. yes. of course.

260
00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:40.260
But for nobility to go to a peasant 
village in the Forsaken Realm...

261
00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:42.840
It'll just be a quick stop.

262
00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:44.050
Right...

263
00:17:44.050 --> 00:17:48.940
I'm sure Yuno would like to see 
everyone back at his church. too. Right?

264
00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:51.030
That's not your concern.

265
00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.360
Now. now...

266
00:17:57.330 --> 00:17:59.700
So that's the demon's skull!

267
00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:09.950
It's quite big. And on top of it is 
a statue of the first Wizard King.

268
00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:14.590
I see. So where is this church?

269
00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:16.040
There.

270
00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:24.600
Oh?

271
00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:26.430
Yuno!

272
00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:28.590
Welcome back!

273
00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:30.440
Thanks.

274
00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:32.530
You've grown so much!

275
00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:37.960
I haven't changed. It's only 
been two months since I left.

276
00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:42.450
Really? But... Yes. Your face has matured.

277
00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:44.780
You look more like an adult.

278
00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:46.620
What brings you here today?

279
00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.450
We're stopping by briefly during our mission.

280
00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:53.070
Why must I visit this village 
in the Forsaken Realm?

281
00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:56.710
Oh. um. hello. I'm Sister Lily.

282
00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:04.470
I'm Klaus Lunettes of the honorable 
Golden Dawn. led by William Vangeance.

283
00:19:04.470 --> 00:19:06.220
I'm a mentor to these new recruits.

284
00:19:06.590 --> 00:19:10.310
Hello. Klaus. Thank you 
for looking after Yuno.

285
00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:13.230
I've heard of you from Yuno's letters.

286
00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:14.630
Letters?

287
00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:16.980
What did you write about me?

288
00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:20.240
Honestly...

289
00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:24.320
I'm Mimosa Vermillion.
 one of Yuno's colleagues.

290
00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:26.830
I've heard of you. too. Mimosa.

291
00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:27.700
Oh!

292
00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:30.470
What did you write about me?

293
00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:33.960
Ah. what a beauty.

294
00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:35.640
Huh?

295
00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:40.280
I am from Hapshass Village.

296
00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:45.720
the son of Lord Hapshass and the heir to 
the Hapshass family. Salim de Hapshass.

297
00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:48.470
It's a pleasure to make your acquaintance.

298
00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:53.680
Oh. I-I'm so sorry! I just...

299
00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:56.880
N-No. it's all right. Sister.

300
00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:04.240
Yuno! It's Yuno!

301
00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:06.550
How are you?!

302
00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:08.620
Welcome back!

303
00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:10.510
What are you doing here. Yuno?

304
00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:13.570
Whoa. that robe's awesome! 
That's the Golden Dawn's.

305
00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:14.920
It's the real thing!

306
00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:17.040
Yay. it's Yuno! Yay! Yay!

307
00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:18.300
Yay!

308
00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:19.910
Hey. where's Asta?

309
00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:21.130
Where's Asta?

310
00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:23.850
Are you keeping in contact with Asta?

311
00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:25.020
No.

312
00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:28.090
Are you staying the night tonight?
 You are. right?

313
00:20:28.090 --> 00:20:29.140
Um...

314
00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:32.240
Unfortunately. we're just stopping by.

315
00:20:32.650 --> 00:20:34.850
We have to hurry on our way.

316
00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:36.480
Aww!

317
00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:40.200
Now. now. we don't have 
to be in such a hurry.

318
00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:42.600
We can spare an hour or so.

319
00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:43.570
But—

320
00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:49.030
In that case. I'll prepare 
some famous Hage tato dishes.

321
00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:50.580
Yuno. stay and have some food.

322
00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:53.460
That goes for all of you. Please. come in.

323
00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:56.120
Wow. what a splendid church.

324
00:20:56.610 --> 00:21:01.030
I've never seen such a 
tiny church. It's so cute.

325
00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:02.250
Tiny?!

326
00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:04.050
It's like a playhouse.

327
00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:05.490
Wha—

328
00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:09.050
Yuno. tell us about the Magic Knights.

329
00:21:09.050 --> 00:21:10.510
Yeah. tell us!

330
00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:11.760
Us!

331
00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:15.430
Why must I enter such a filthy little church?

332
00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:37.680
No one can escape from here

333
00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:44.430
Once again in the small closed off classroom

334
00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:52.720
The star of the class was shining yet again

335
00:21:53.270 --> 00:21:59.120
They shine so bright that I close my eyes

336
00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:02.610
I've thought many times

337
00:22:02.610 --> 00:22:06.320
That the revolution was within my hands

338
00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:13.860
Isn't it strange? If you want 
to laugh. go ahead and laugh

339
00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:20.750
The rest of us who were left 
behind wanted to become something

340
00:22:20.750 --> 00:22:28.010
We repeat the same morning over and over

341
00:22:28.010 --> 00:22:34.890
You're the only one who 
can choose your tomorrow

342
00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:39.560
Let's go beyond our current selves

343
00:22:53.950 --> 00:22:58.410
Petit Clover

344
00:22:54.890 --> 00:22:57.430
Petit Clover!

345
00:22:57.910 --> 00:23:02.140
Sekke's Bah-ha Seminar! Part 2

346
00:22:58.670 --> 00:23:01.910
Sekke's Bah-ha Seminar. Part 2!

347
00:23:01.910 --> 00:23:03.670
We're still doing this?

348
00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:06.030
But of course. Asta.

349
00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:09.760
You haven't learned the 
ways of bah-ha at all yet.

350
00:23:10.310 --> 00:23:12.700
Your Shooting Star's pretty cool!

351
00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:14.850
Ah. so you understand how grand it is!

352
00:23:14.850 --> 00:23:18.310
That part in front is especially awesome!

353
00:23:18.310 --> 00:23:21.060
Good. You are starting to 
understand the ways of bah-ha!

354
00:23:21.060 --> 00:23:23.740
I see. So that's bah-ha.

355
00:23:23.740 --> 00:23:26.520
Yes. Starting today. you have attained bah-ha!

356
00:23:26.520 --> 00:23:30.570
Bah-hahaha! Bah-hahaha!

357
00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:30.570
Bah-hahaha!

358
00:23:30.570 --> 00:23:32.570
Men are so stupid.

359
00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:38.730
Curse that Yuno! He's so 
insolent for a new recruit.

360
00:23:38.730 --> 00:23:43.500
I'm your senior! If you don't listen to me.
you'll feel the wrath of my glasses!

361
00:23:43.500 --> 00:23:47.380
Black Clover. Page 13:
"The Wizard King Saw. Continued."

362
00:23:44.420 --> 00:23:51.140
Page 13
The Wizard King Saw. Continued

363
00:23:47.380 --> 00:23:49.840
Not giving up is my magic!

364
00:23:50.305 --> 00:24:50.688
